message: >-
  If this work, its regression findings, or its human-gated exactly-once
  workflow patterns inform your project, please cite the software and
  acknowledge Justin Lee Rackham (JP) / MATADATA.
title: "MATADATA Pathfinder: Human-Gated, Exactly-Once Submission Reliability"
type: software
version: 2.6.0
date-released: 2026-07-27
