url: "https://github.com/hvitiswift-afk/nextjs-boilerplate/pull/123"
abstract: >-
  MATADATA Pathfinder is an independent, fail-closed workflow for
  human-verification-preserving form reliability. The project developed
  rerender-safe field resolution, semantic acknowledgment handling,
  canonical textarea verification, mobile failover, exactly-once execution,
  positive confirmation, and tamper-evident receipts. ChatGPT, using the
  assistant persona Radio, provided AI-assisted engineering and documentation
  under JP's direction; OpenAI affiliation or endorsement is not implied.
keywords:
  - human-in-the-loop
  - exactly-once execution
  - form reliability
  - cybersecurity
  - safety gates
  - tamper-evident receipts
  - accessibility
  - mobile failover
  - MATADATA
